        "subject": "Congratulations! You Have Been Selected for the Next Round",
        "message": "=<div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333;\">\n\n  <h2>Congratulations, {{ $json.Name }}!</h2>\n\n  <p>We are pleased to inform you that you have been <strong>selected for the next round</strong> of our recruitment process for the <strong>{{ $json[\"Applied Role\"] }}</strong> position.</p>\n\n  <p>Thank you for your time and effort throughout the selection process. Our recruitment team will contact you with the interview schedule and further instructions.</p>\n\n  <h3>Next Round – Please Keep Ready</h3>\n\n  <ul>\n    <li>Updated resume</li>\n    <li>Government-issued ID</li>\n    <li>Academic certificates / mark sheets</li>\n    <li>Relevant project or work samples</li>\n  </ul>\n\n  <p>Please keep your contact details updated and check your email regularly for the interview invitation and scheduling information.</p>\n\n  <p><strong>Next step:</strong> Please be available to attend the second-round interview once the schedule is shared by our recruitment team.</p>\n\n  <p>We look forward to speaking with you.</p>\n\n  <br>\n\n  <p>\n    Best regards,<br>\n    <strong>Recruitment Team</strong><br>\n    Talent Acquisition\n  </p>\n\n</div>",
